  - m_Id: 1270574399488
    m_Localized: Start
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1294930722816
    m_Localized: "You will now see a picture of objects that were placed in an environment.
      Afterwards, you will see the empty environment and your task will be to reconstruct
      the scene by placing the objects at the same spot that you saw them in. \r\n\r\nThere
      is a trial run first. Afterwards the experiment starts.\r\n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1353437069312
    m_Localized: Drag and Drop the objects in the scene
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1402959216640
    m_Localized: Move the object with your mouse. To change the depth use the "W"
      and "S" keys, to change the scale use "A" and "D". Use the mousewheel to zoom
      in or out of the scene.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1443941761024
    m_Localized: '"A" and "D" keys to change the scale of the object'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1470491705344
    m_Localized: '"W" and "S" keys to change the depth of the object'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1496865488896
    m_Localized: Confirm
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1631716556800
    m_Localized: Use the mouse to drag the object around
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1661609361408
